What’s new:
Added Free Mode;

Completed scenes are saved automatically. Unlocked sex scenes in Free Mode stay available even after creating a new character;

Two new achievements added for Free Mode;

Gallery updated with several new collectible illustrations. Previous ones slightly improved;

Main Menu completely redesigned;

German language added;

Other localizations updated;



