In the next update we plan to:
Update the main storyline;

Add more additional sex scenes;

Add direct control for sex scenes;

Adapt scenes to the new UI;

Also fix known Free Mode issues, add hair color options, and add a Male Character Creator for gay scenes;

For our other games, our goals are:
Release a major update for Cuckold House with an improved look for Layla (the cuckold’s wife), new sex scenes in various rooms, and direct control if Jacob (the cuckold husband) is involved.

Add female customization (appearance & outfits) in Fast Hands. Add a Gallery with illustrations unlocked for each challenge, plus more fetish variety.

Hello, exorcists! In this update:

 Added sex mission “Purgatory”;
 In “Purgatory” there will be 6 sex scenes available, 3 of them are femdom;
 Added the ability to zoom in and out the camera in sex scenes;
 Completely updated gallery (however, four images will be released in the next update);
 Added buttons to hide dialog boxes;
 Increased moisture in Evelyn's body and clothing
 Added a large number of sound effects;
Added two new achievements;
 Fixed minor bugs.


The next update is planned to add a Free Mode, which will allow you to create your own female character with direct control during sex scenes.
